{"model": "medium.en-q5_0", "slug": "C_S03E08", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.1, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 2.1, "end": 4.18, "text": "- Why did I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 4.18, "end": 7.22, "text": "- So I could keep my job and get busy with my education."}, {"start": 9.38, "end": 11.06, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 11.06, "end": 12.72, "text": "- Because Greendale's a slam dunk."}, {"start": 14.98, "end": 15.86, "text": "- So why should you?"}, {"start": 15.86, "end": 16.68, "text": "- Why should you?"}, {"start": 16.68, "end": 17.94, "text": "- Why should you go Greendale?"}, {"start": 17.94, "end": 19.08, "text": "- That's easy."}, {"start": 19.08, "end": 21.34, "text": "Greendale has the most advanced typing class"}, {"start": 21.34, "end": 23.06, "text": "in the Southwestern Greendale area,"}, {"start": 23.06, "end": 25.18, "text": "and now you can register by fax."}, {"start": 25.18, "end": 28.02, "text": "- Go Greendale, go Greendale, go!"}, {"start": 28.02, "end": 29.82, "text": "- That, as you probably know,"}, {"start": 29.82, "end": 32.16, "text": "is the currently running commercial for our school."}, {"start": 32.16, "end": 34.32, "text": "- Yeah, I always see it during late night marathons"}, {"start": 34.32, "end": 35.28, "text": "of Fantasy Island."}, {"start": 35.28, "end": 36.48, "text": "- That's not an accident."}, {"start": 36.48, "end": 38.28, "text": "It's the result of intensive targeting."}, {"start": 38.28, "end": 40.6, "text": "But now, Greendale School Board"}, {"start": 40.6, "end": 45.2, "text": "has given me a budget of $2,000 to update our little ad."}, {"start": 45.2, "end": 46.6, "text": "- Are you sure it should change?"}, {"start": 46.6, "end": 47.98, "text": "I chose Greendale over City College"}, {"start": 47.98, "end": 50.48, "text": "because of the way that one dude goes."}, {"start": 50.48, "end": 52.36, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 52.36, "end": 54.8, "text": "- You know I love to be seen agreeing with you, Troy."}, {"start": 54.8, "end": 56.2, "text": "But this is our chance"}, {"start": 56.2, "end": 58.92, "text": "to make Greendale's most reasonable dreams come true."}, {"start": 58.92, "end": 61.64, "text": "and I need your help, all of you."}, {"start": 63.2, "end": 64.44, "text": "That's okay, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 64.44, "end": 65.8, "text": "You can say no."}, {"start": 65.8, "end": 67.4, "text": "This school asks very little of its students."}, {"start": 67.4, "end": 69.32, "text": "It mainly gives."}, {"start": 69.32, "end": 71.92, "text": "I feel like you guys might know what I'm talking about."}, {"start": 74.4, "end": 75.56, "text": "- How can we help?"}, {"start": 75.56, "end": 77.32, "text": "- Oh, thanks for asking."}, {"start": 77.32, "end": 79.72, "text": "I've chosen you, Greendale's brightest,"}, {"start": 79.72, "end": 81.2, "text": "most coincidentally diverse,"}, {"start": 81.2, "end": 83.0, "text": "Hispanics notwithstanding study group,"}, {"start": 83.0, "end": 85.68, "text": "to star in our commercial."}, {"start": 85.68, "end": 87.8, "text": "Pick a character, we start this weekend."}, {"start": 87.8, "end": 91.8, "text": "But if we're shooting this weekend, why are these cameras here?"}, {"start": 91.8, "end": 97.2, "text": "Abed, true to form, has decided to do the weird thing and film a documentary instead"}, {"start": 97.2, "end": 98.2, "text": "of helping."}, {"start": 98.2, "end": 100.74, "text": "As a student of character, I have a feeling that trying to make this commercial may cost"}, {"start": 100.74, "end": 101.74, "text": "the Dean his sanity."}, {"start": 101.74, "end": 104.44, "text": "And my camera follows the fire, not the smoke."}, {"start": 104.44, "end": 105.82, "text": "Ever seen Hearts of Darkness?"}, {"start": 105.82, "end": 107.28, "text": "Way better than Apocalypse Now."}, {"start": 107.28, "end": 109.16, "text": "What's the catering search gonna be on this picture?"}, {"start": 109.16, "end": 110.24, "text": "This isn't Hollywood Pierce."}, {"start": 110.24, "end": 114.32, "text": "If it was, these glasses would be tinted and I'd be friends with Stevie Nicks."}, {"start": 114.32, "end": 115.32, "text": "No catering."}, {"start": 115.32, "end": 116.32, "text": "This is outrageous."}, {"start": 116.32, "end": 118.14, "text": "my trailer till there's food."}, {"start": 118.14, "end": 119.26, "text": "You don't have a trailer."}, {"start": 119.26, "end": 121.06, "text": "Well, then I'll rent a trailer, and I won't leave it"}, {"start": 121.06, "end": 123.64, "text": "till I have the one I don't have."}, {"start": 123.64, "end": 125.14, "text": "I'm an actor, not a circus freak."}, {"start": 125.14, "end": 126.54, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 126.54, "end": 128.5, "text": "I need to go that way."}, {"start": 128.5, "end": 129.78, "text": "Eh, I'll loop around."}, {"start": 129.78, "end": 130.68, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 130.68, "end": 134.24, "text": "(SINGING) Give me some more time in a dream."}, {"start": 134.24, "end": 137.48, "text": "Give me the hope to run out of steam."}, {"start": 137.48, "end": 140.88, "text": "Somebody said it could be here."}, {"start": 140.88, "end": 144.88, "text": "We could be roped up, tied up, dead in a year."}, {"start": 144.88, "end": 149.88, "text": "♪ I can't count the reasons I should stay ♪"}, {"start": 149.92, "end": 154.34, "text": "♪ One by one they all just fade away ♪"}, {"start": 157.94, "end": 160.86, "text": "- All right, let's rehearse this mamma jamma."}, {"start": 160.86, "end": 162.98, "text": "Does everyone know who they are?"}, {"start": 162.98, "end": 164.18, "text": "Where's my script girl?"}, {"start": 164.18, "end": 165.86, "text": "- It's supervisor and I'm right behind you."}, {"start": 165.86, "end": 168.06, "text": "- Thank you, supervisor girl."}, {"start": 168.06, "end": 169.96, "text": "Faster than a locomotive."}, {"start": 169.96, "end": 171.38, "text": "- A script supervisor is the person"}, {"start": 171.38, "end": 172.82, "text": "that tells everyone to stay on script"}, {"start": 172.82, "end": 176.36, "text": "and keeps careful notes to prevent logical inconsistencies."}, {"start": 176.36, "end": 178.86, "text": "So, basically the star."}, {"start": 178.86, "end": 181.4, "text": "- We open on a typical day at Greendale,"}, {"start": 181.4, "end": 182.94, "text": "only the students all look happy"}, {"start": 182.94, "end": 184.5, "text": "and you can't smell that smell."}, {"start": 184.5, "end": 185.34, "text": "Troy?"}, {"start": 185.34, "end": 187.24, "text": "- Why do I go, Greendale?"}, {"start": 187.24, "end": 188.48, "text": "- With three kids at home,"}, {"start": 188.48, "end": 190.44, "text": "you better believe every penny counts."}, {"start": 190.44, "end": 192.02, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 192.02, "end": 194.12, "text": "- And then, you and Troy hug,"}, {"start": 194.12, "end": 195.44, "text": "if you're comfortable with that."}, {"start": 195.44, "end": 196.28, "text": "- Of course."}, {"start": 196.28, "end": 197.12, "text": "- Yeah, Troy and I are buds."}, {"start": 197.12, "end": 198.82, "text": "Best buds, air buds, even."}, {"start": 202.16, "end": 203.42, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 203.42, "end": 205.16, "text": "- So you're feeling stupid."}, {"start": 205.16, "end": 208.9, "text": "- And then the camera pans and enter Dean Pelton."}, {"start": 208.9, "end": 210.7, "text": "- I got stuck with the role of the dean,"}, {"start": 210.7, "end": 213.46, "text": "so I'm gonna show him how much of a dean I can be."}, {"start": 213.46, "end": 216.62, "text": "And I've got a feeling I won't make the cut."}, {"start": 216.62, "end": 219.3, "text": "- Welcome to Deandale Community College, Dean."}, {"start": 219.3, "end": 221.06, "text": "I'm a silly goose."}, {"start": 221.06, "end": 224.54, "text": "Honk, honk, Deanily-do, look at me."}, {"start": 224.54, "end": 226.54, "text": "- Stop. - This is my sister's outfit."}, {"start": 226.54, "end": 227.56, "text": "- Stop."}, {"start": 228.86, "end": 231.38, "text": "You've hit gold, save some for the screen."}, {"start": 231.38, "end": 233.1, "text": "All right, people, scene six is up first."}, {"start": 233.1, "end": 234.8, "text": "Oh, and I don't think Pierce is coming back."}, {"start": 234.8, "end": 236.86, "text": "Can someone fill in as the pencil?"}, {"start": 236.86, "end": 238.88, "text": "- Pierce Hawthorne, screen and stage and star"}, {"start": 238.88, "end": 241.48, "text": "will not leave this trailer until he gets a trailer."}, {"start": 242.34, "end": 245.78, "text": "And then I'm not leaving that trailer until it's catering."}, {"start": 245.78, "end": 247.06, "text": "And I'm not eating the food until--"}, {"start": 247.06, "end": 248.78, "text": "- And action."}, {"start": 248.78, "end": 250.18, "text": "Why go Greendale?"}, {"start": 250.18, "end": 254.34, "text": "Just because, just dean it, dean machine."}, {"start": 254.34, "end": 255.98, "text": "Got dean, got much, much, got--"}, {"start": 255.98, "end": 257.26, "text": "And cut."}, {"start": 257.26, "end": 259.02, "text": "Oh, a star is born."}, {"start": 259.02, "end": 261.42, "text": "I suggested to the dean that we shoot my scenes"}, {"start": 261.42, "end": 263.62, "text": "in front of the Louise Guzman statue"}, {"start": 263.62, "end": 265.34, "text": "because the dean has no legal right"}, {"start": 265.34, "end": 267.0, "text": "to broadcast Guzman's image,"}, {"start": 267.0, "end": 269.66, "text": "which means every shot will be unusable."}, {"start": 269.66, "end": 272.5, "text": "- I even put a call into Guzman's lawyers to alert them."}, {"start": 272.5, "end": 273.92, "text": "I'm always willing to go the extra mile"}, {"start": 273.92, "end": 275.38, "text": "to avoid doing something."}, {"start": 275.38, "end": 276.74, "text": "- Like sex with women."}, {"start": 276.74, "end": 278.86, "text": "- Shut up, Leonard, you smell like mentholyptus."}, {"start": 278.86, "end": 280.1, "text": "What are you even doing here?"}, {"start": 280.1, "end": 282.78, "text": "- I'm thinking about breaking into the TV game"}, {"start": 282.78, "end": 285.66, "text": "since it's apparently sticking around."}, {"start": 285.66, "end": 289.82, "text": "I want to wake up in 30 years and wonder, what if?"}, {"start": 289.82, "end": 292.38, "text": "Because this full-time mama ain't breaking the bank"}, {"start": 292.38, "end": 294.26, "text": "with your expensive tuition."}, {"start": 294.26, "end": 295.16, "text": "OK, cut."}, {"start": 295.16, "end": 297.02, "text": "Shirley, the voice."}, {"start": 297.02, "end": 299.04, "text": "Can you make it, um--"}, {"start": 299.04, "end": 301.9, "text": "I thought it would be more s--"}, {"start": 301.9, "end": 304.78, "text": "what's another word that means happy, threatening?"}, {"start": 304.78, "end": 307.3, "text": "The word he's looking for is sassy."}, {"start": 307.3, "end": 310.06, "text": "He better pray he don't find it."}, {"start": 310.06, "end": 312.62, "text": "As soon as we get this shot, we are done."}, {"start": 312.62, "end": 314.9, "text": "Your phone is ringing."}, {"start": 314.9, "end": 316.86, "text": "- Dean Deaning. - Dean Poulton?"}, {"start": 316.86, "end": 318.98, "text": "Hey, man, how you doin'? It's Louie Guzman."}, {"start": 318.98, "end": 320.82, "text": "I hear you're makin' a commercial for Greendale"}, {"start": 320.82, "end": 323.82, "text": "and you need permission to use my face or somethin'."}, {"start": 323.82, "end": 326.62, "text": "Well, I, um, uh..."}, {"start": 326.62, "end": 329.12, "text": "Well, why not use the real thing?"}, {"start": 329.12, "end": 333.08, "text": "- I'm sorry? - I'm sayin' I'd love to be in your commercial."}, {"start": 333.08, "end": 334.62, "text": "Wowee!"}, {"start": 334.62, "end": 339.76, "text": "A real big-time celebrity wants to be in my commercial!"}, {"start": 339.76, "end": 342.8, "text": "Wowee! A real big-time celebrity wants to be in my commercial."}, {"start": 342.8, "end": 344.02, "text": "- Come on down. - Yeah, that's cool."}, {"start": 344.02, "end": 346.52, "text": "But listen, I got to finish this movie, so you know,"}, {"start": 346.52, "end": 348.78, "text": "I can't come for a couple of weeks, all right?"}, {"start": 348.78, "end": 350.74, "text": "Mr. Guzman, Luis, thank you."}, {"start": 350.74, "end": 353.14, "text": "And can I just say, I loved you in--"}, {"start": 353.14, "end": 354.7, "text": "[SNAPPING FINGERS]"}, {"start": 354.7, "end": 362.98, "text": "In IMDB."}, {"start": 362.98, "end": 365.34, "text": "See you soon, ma'am."}, {"start": 365.34, "end": 368.02, "text": "That was tragic."}, {"start": 368.02, "end": 369.22, "text": "The students here mean well."}, {"start": 369.22, "end": 370.14, "text": "They really do."}, {"start": 370.14, "end": 373.28, "text": "But what Greenville has always needed is a miracle."}, {"start": 373.28, "end": 374.12, "text": "This is it."}, {"start": 375.08, "end": 377.16, "text": "This is how I get to put Greendale on the map."}, {"start": 377.16, "end": 379.76, "text": "You know, I thought this commercial was gonna be okay."}, {"start": 379.76, "end": 380.84, "text": "Well, guess what?"}, {"start": 380.84, "end": 383.16, "text": "It just officially became great."}, {"start": 383.16, "end": 384.44, "text": "Let me give you a little rundown"}, {"start": 384.44, "end": 386.42, "text": "of this commercial's great elements."}, {"start": 386.42, "end": 389.1, "text": "Luis Guzman is in it."}, {"start": 393.38, "end": 395.24, "text": "I'm sorry, will you excuse me?"}, {"start": 395.24, "end": 397.88, "text": "Everyone gather around, quick announcement."}, {"start": 397.88, "end": 399.28, "text": "Come on around."}, {"start": 399.28, "end": 402.8, "text": "Everything that we shot so far is worthless."}, {"start": 402.8, "end": 405.2, "text": "I've thrown it out and we're starting over tomorrow morning."}, {"start": 405.2, "end": 406.08, "text": "- Why?"}, {"start": 406.08, "end": 410.6, "text": "- Because Louise Guzman is in the commercial now."}, {"start": 410.6, "end": 412.88, "text": "So yeah, for realsies."}, {"start": 412.88, "end": 414.24, "text": "Everyone, go home."}, {"start": 414.24, "end": 416.34, "text": "I'm rewriting all of your parts."}, {"start": 417.88, "end": 419.52, "text": "Except for you, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 419.52, "end": 421.7, "text": "You have locked into something here."}, {"start": 421.7, "end": 424.04, "text": "And the only thing your character needs"}, {"start": 425.36, "end": 426.46, "text": "is more screen time."}, {"start": 428.42, "end": 429.6, "text": "- It's great that he got a celebrity,"}, {"start": 429.6, "end": 431.28, "text": "but why reshoot everything?"}, {"start": 431.28, "end": 432.12, "text": "- Perfectionism."}, {"start": 432.12, "end": 435.0, "text": "the Dean's first step down a road that ends in self-destruction."}, {"start": 435.0, "end": 437.16, "text": "That sounds... horrible."}, {"start": 437.16, "end": 439.66, "text": "Actually, I might end up taking this to some festivals."}, {"start": 447.34, "end": 449.88, "text": "The Dean's production has taken over the entire school."}, {"start": 449.88, "end": 451.02, "text": "Classes are shut down,"}, {"start": 451.02, "end": 452.94, "text": "the quilting club is being forced to sew costumes."}, {"start": 452.94, "end": 457.52, "text": "Two females, both 5'10\", one brunette, one with asthma."}, {"start": 457.52, "end": 459.78, "text": "He's also using the PA system for casting calls."}, {"start": 459.78, "end": 461.48, "text": "Okay, everyone,"}, {"start": 461.48, "end": 462.96, "text": "Does everyone have their new script?"}, {"start": 462.96, "end": 465.88, "text": "Uh, it says I'm supposed to be a book, reading a book?"}, {"start": 465.88, "end": 467.2, "text": "That-- that doesn't make sense."}, {"start": 467.2, "end": 468.1, "text": "Ahem."}, {"start": 473.04, "end": 474.12, "text": "What's this?"}, {"start": 474.12, "end": 476.2, "text": "Scene four."}, {"start": 476.2, "end": 478.28, "text": "Last night I had an epiphany."}, {"start": 478.28, "end": 480.36, "text": "I'm ready to step this mother up a notch."}, {"start": 480.36, "end": 482.4, "text": "This commercial is going to push every button, starting"}, {"start": 482.4, "end": 484.04, "text": "with the one that is so hot."}, {"start": 484.04, "end": 485.88, "text": "It will sizzle your finger."}, {"start": 485.88, "end": 487.8, "text": "Race."}, {"start": 487.8, "end": 489.2, "text": "And action."}, {"start": 489.2, "end": 491.74, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 491.74, "end": 493.3, "text": "- Cut, I'm coming in."}, {"start": 498.7, "end": 502.12, "text": "I am trying to pull a 400-year-old dagger"}, {"start": 502.12, "end": 505.92, "text": "out of this nation's heart, and you two are hugging."}, {"start": 507.72, "end": 509.92, "text": "I understand, but you..."}, {"start": 509.92, "end": 510.82, "text": "- What did I do?"}, {"start": 510.82, "end": 511.72, "text": "- You didn't."}, {"start": 511.72, "end": 513.08, "text": "Let's take it again."}, {"start": 513.08, "end": 515.06, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 516.46, "end": 517.72, "text": "- Again."}, {"start": 517.72, "end": 520.16, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 520.16, "end": 521.56, "text": "- I need more!"}, {"start": 521.56, "end": 522.84, "text": "More!"}, {"start": 522.84, "end": 523.68, "text": "Wrong!"}, {"start": 523.68, "end": 524.68, "text": "Fight the power!"}, {"start": 524.68, "end": 526.1, "text": "Fight it with your hugs!"}, {"start": 526.1, "end": 528.32, "text": "Tear down those walls!"}, {"start": 528.32, "end": 529.72, "text": "(clapping)"}, {"start": 529.72, "end": 531.4, "text": "Can you get this wrong one more time?"}, {"start": 531.4, "end": 533.62, "text": "I'm segregating the school."}, {"start": 533.62, "end": 534.92, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 535.92, "end": 538.04, "text": "- You can't even do it when we're helping you!"}, {"start": 538.04, "end": 539.54, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 539.54, "end": 540.64, "text": "- Somebody help her!"}, {"start": 540.64, "end": 542.04, "text": "- To meet different people!"}, {"start": 542.04, "end": 543.92, "text": "- Stop saying I'm different!"}, {"start": 543.92, "end": 546.92, "text": "- Dean, we've spent 12 hours on this scene."}, {"start": 546.92, "end": 549.02, "text": "Maybe it's time to move on to something else."}, {"start": 549.02, "end": 552.52, "text": "- I'm in Psych 101 and even I don't know what's happening."}, {"start": 552.52, "end": 554.96, "text": "- The Dean is going insane and taking all of you with him."}, {"start": 554.96, "end": 557.52, "text": "- If you know that, then do something."}, {"start": 557.52, "end": 558.52, "text": "- I'm doing everything I can."}, {"start": 558.52, "end": 559.92, "text": "I only have so many cameras."}, {"start": 563.4, "end": 564.66, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 564.66, "end": 568.12, "text": "- I've spent an entire day in this thing for no reason."}, {"start": 568.12, "end": 570.36, "text": "One of the shoot drags on for another day,"}, {"start": 570.36, "end": 571.64, "text": "or God forbid, two."}, {"start": 574.72, "end": 576.24, "text": "And action and move."}, {"start": 576.24, "end": 578.2, "text": "This full-time mama ain't breaking the bank."}, {"start": 578.2, "end": 579.24, "text": "- Cut, cut, cut, cut, cut, cut, cut."}, {"start": 579.24, "end": 581.24, "text": "Gary, you're not taking advantage"}, {"start": 581.24, "end": 582.76, "text": "of the motion capture technology."}, {"start": 582.76, "end": 584.04, "text": "You have to move."}, {"start": 584.04, "end": 585.4, "text": "- I forgot what I am again."}, {"start": 585.4, "end": 586.76, "text": "- Oh, for crying out loud."}, {"start": 586.76, "end": 588.84, "text": "You are a microscope."}, {"start": 588.84, "end": 590.28, "text": "- No, that's a toilet."}, {"start": 590.28, "end": 592.88, "text": "- No, that's clearly a frog who can't get out of a box."}, {"start": 592.88, "end": 594.84, "text": "- Jeff thinks he has it bad?"}, {"start": 594.84, "end": 596.2, "text": "As Jeff's understudy,"}, {"start": 596.2, "end": 598.4, "text": "I have to wear my Jeff wig on top of my Chang hair"}, {"start": 598.4, "end": 600.24, "text": "and then my ball cap on top of that."}, {"start": 600.24, "end": 601.96, "text": "There's no air getting through here."}, {"start": 601.96, "end": 603.8, "text": "I'm literally dying."}, {"start": 603.8, "end": 606.12, "text": "But you'll never hear my story."}, {"start": 606.12, "end": 609.16, "text": "I mean, now you heard it, but that was close."}, {"start": 609.16, "end": 611.12, "text": "- Are you sure you can't work a little faster?"}, {"start": 611.12, "end": 612.7, "text": "Nobody asked for perfection."}, {"start": 612.7, "end": 614.52, "text": "- Well, perfection is what you're getting."}, {"start": 614.52, "end": 616.94, "text": "And if you don't like it, you can fire me."}, {"start": 616.94, "end": 619.0, "text": "- Yeah, if we don't like it at this point,"}, {"start": 619.0, "end": 620.48, "text": "we definitely will fire you."}, {"start": 620.48, "end": 623.14, "text": "- Good, that's how I like it, huh?"}, {"start": 624.12, "end": 625.66, "text": "I'm surrounded by assassins."}, {"start": 625.66, "end": 628.08, "text": "My own school's paper has turned on me."}, {"start": 628.08, "end": 629.64, "text": "But when this is all over,"}, {"start": 629.64, "end": 631.96, "text": "I'll have a commercial with Louise Guzman in it,"}, {"start": 631.96, "end": 635.68, "text": "and all they'll have are their words and their fears"}, {"start": 635.68, "end": 637.6, "text": "and whatever embarrassing photos they can get"}, {"start": 637.6, "end": 639.02, "text": "from my two-faced mother."}, {"start": 640.72, "end": 642.28, "text": "- Garrett, I've got two men in diapers here."}, {"start": 642.28, "end": 643.28, "text": "I know one of them is playing"}, {"start": 643.28, "end": 644.74, "text": "the dawn of a new era in education,"}, {"start": 644.74, "end": 645.94, "text": "but I've got nothing on the other one."}, {"start": 645.94, "end": 647.8, "text": "- Oh, I'm just a guest of the Dean's."}, {"start": 648.64, "end": 650.84, "text": "- Well, both of you go that way then."}, {"start": 650.84, "end": 652.72, "text": "The Dean had his seventh epiphany today,"}, {"start": 652.72, "end": 654.56, "text": "which has given me an epiphany of my own."}, {"start": 654.56, "end": 656.8, "text": "The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 656.8, "end": 657.72, "text": "He has to be."}, {"start": 657.72, "end": 660.04, "text": "If he isn't, I've given almost two weeks of my life"}, {"start": 660.04, "end": 660.88, "text": "to an idiot."}, {"start": 660.88, "end": 661.92, "text": "That is unacceptable."}, {"start": 661.92, "end": 664.76, "text": "Therefore, the Dean is a genius,"}, {"start": 664.76, "end": 667.76, "text": "And I will die protecting his vision."}, {"start": 667.76, "end": 670.52, "text": "- Are you by any chance familiar with Stockholm syndrome?"}, {"start": 670.52, "end": 671.92, "text": "- Is it something that the dean created?"}, {"start": 671.92, "end": 673.48, "text": "Because if not, I don't care."}, {"start": 673.48, "end": 675.84, "text": "- We all want to go, but the dean won't let us."}, {"start": 675.84, "end": 678.22, "text": "I think Pierce played this the smartest from the beginning."}, {"start": 678.22, "end": 680.0, "text": "He's probably at home watching forensic files"}, {"start": 680.0, "end": 681.3, "text": "and eating cheesy popcorn."}, {"start": 686.6, "end": 688.84, "text": "- Well, about time!"}, {"start": 688.84, "end": 691.6, "text": "- Hey, that's for Luis Guzman."}, {"start": 691.6, "end": 694.96, "text": "Well, when you get me my trailer, he can have it back,"}, {"start": 694.96, "end": 697.58, "text": "and make it as nice as this one."}, {"start": 697.58, "end": 698.48, "text": "Hey, Dean."}, {"start": 698.48, "end": 699.38, "text": "Dean!"}, {"start": 699.38, "end": 700.28, "text": "Hey, Dean."}, {"start": 700.28, "end": 701.96, "text": "Pierce mistook me for the Dean today."}, {"start": 701.96, "end": 702.86, "text": "I want windows."}, {"start": 702.86, "end": 705.28, "text": "How did that make you feel?"}, {"start": 705.28, "end": 707.44, "text": "I've become a stranger to myself."}, {"start": 707.44, "end": 708.8, "text": "I'm bald now."}, {"start": 708.8, "end": 710.68, "text": "I've always been bald."}, {"start": 710.68, "end": 712.96, "text": "I really dreamt of having hair."}, {"start": 712.96, "end": 715.48, "text": "And now the bald man is awake."}, {"start": 715.48, "end": 717.32, "text": "Jeff?"}, {"start": 717.32, "end": 718.22, "text": "It's time."}, {"start": 721.6, "end": 725.5, "text": "Lights, camera, Dean."}, {"start": 725.5, "end": 727.5, "text": "Action."}, {"start": 727.5, "end": 729.1, "text": "Why go Greendale?"}, {"start": 729.1, "end": 730.9, "text": "Just because."}, {"start": 730.9, "end": 731.8, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 731.8, "end": 733.4, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 735.4, "end": 737.3, "text": "Lose the bald cap."}, {"start": 737.3, "end": 738.0, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 738.0, "end": 738.9, "text": "I don't like it."}, {"start": 738.9, "end": 739.5, "text": "It's hokey."}, {"start": 739.5, "end": 740.2, "text": "It's fake."}, {"start": 740.2, "end": 741.0, "text": "Take it off."}, {"start": 745.3, "end": 746.2, "text": "No."}, {"start": 749.7, "end": 751.5, "text": "Beg your pardon"}, {"start": 751.5, "end": 758.46, "text": "Actor I have worn this stupid thing for 12 days. I have made bald friends. That's your mistake"}, {"start": 759.38, "end": 765.98, "text": "Because it's a lie. It's Hollywood crap, and I won't allow it in my commercial. You are not oh"}, {"start": 767.02, "end": 769.02, "text": "Yes"}, {"start": 769.06, "end": 772.22, "text": "Well, then you're wrong for the part"}, {"start": 773.7, "end": 775.7, "text": "Understudy"}, {"start": 779.7, "end": 782.0, "text": "That's it."}, {"start": 782.0, "end": 784.9, "text": "That's reality."}, {"start": 784.9, "end": 787.5, "text": "Winger, you're done. Go home."}, {"start": 787.5, "end": 789.7, "text": "Go home."}, {"start": 789.7, "end": 792.6, "text": "Okay, I don't know why, but this is the last straw."}, {"start": 792.6, "end": 794.4, "text": "As a licensed psychology major,"}, {"start": 794.4, "end": 798.2, "text": "I am declaring this production a violation of human rights."}, {"start": 798.2, "end": 801.1, "text": "You have made us prisoners of your insanity!"}, {"start": 801.1, "end": 802.6, "text": "Shut your face, Britta!"}, {"start": 802.6, "end": 805.6, "text": "If the dean wants his role to be played by a Chinese man"}, {"start": 805.6, "end": 808.2, "text": "in a blonde whip..."}, {"start": 808.2, "end": 809.64, "text": "Oh, my God, you are insane."}, {"start": 809.64, "end": 812.4, "text": "All right, I'm sick and tired of hearing complaints"}, {"start": 812.4, "end": 814.5, "text": "that I'm forcing people to be here."}, {"start": 814.5, "end": 819.18, "text": "Anyone who doesn't want to help me can leave."}, {"start": 819.18, "end": 822.38, "text": "[ Sighs ]"}, {"start": 822.38, "end": 831.42, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 831.42, "end": 832.82, "text": "Up and stop."}, {"start": 832.82, "end": 834.96, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 834.96, "end": 837.1, "text": "Keep rolling."}, {"start": 838.2, "end": 841.28, "text": "(car engine revving)"}, {"start": 847.88, "end": 849.92, "text": "- Hello, hello?"}, {"start": 849.92, "end": 850.74, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 858.88, "end": 861.22, "text": "Hello, it's me, Louis Guzman."}, {"start": 863.38, "end": 864.22, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 864.22, "end": 866.68, "text": "- Hi, hi, Mr. Guzman."}, {"start": 866.68, "end": 869.44, "text": "Dean slash director, Craig Pelton."}, {"start": 869.44, "end": 872.96, "text": "Sorry, I've been editing, it's a little bit of a mess."}, {"start": 875.3, "end": 876.8, "text": "- What the (beep) is that?"}, {"start": 876.8, "end": 877.92, "text": "- Oh, that's a possum."}, {"start": 877.92, "end": 879.2, "text": "Once you spend some time with them,"}, {"start": 879.2, "end": 881.4, "text": "you see they're just like big, gentle rats."}, {"start": 884.72, "end": 885.56, "text": "- Who's the guy?"}, {"start": 885.56, "end": 886.4, "text": "- I'm no one."}, {"start": 886.4, "end": 888.26, "text": "- That's Abed, he's a little bit odd."}, {"start": 889.16, "end": 890.92, "text": "Now, without further ado,"}, {"start": 890.92, "end": 893.34, "text": "here is the commercial you will be starring in."}, {"start": 894.76, "end": 897.92, "text": "♪ I'm just a dear one ♪"}, {"start": 897.92, "end": 899.34, "text": "♪ Why do I go, Greenville ♪"}, {"start": 899.34, "end": 902.5, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 902.5, "end": 904.92, "text": "(explosions)"}, {"start": 906.0, "end": 907.84, "text": "♪ I walk the wall ♪"}, {"start": 907.84, "end": 910.42, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 912.46, "end": 914.62, "text": "- I gotta make a phone call."}, {"start": 914.62, "end": 917.42, "text": "I had to tell this dean I couldn't do his commercial."}, {"start": 917.42, "end": 920.02, "text": "He didn't take that too well either."}, {"start": 920.02, "end": 921.26, "text": "Y'all gotta help this dude."}, {"start": 921.26, "end": 922.58, "text": "I mean, aren't you his friends?"}, {"start": 922.58, "end": 924.62, "text": "- I'm more of a fly on the wall."}, {"start": 924.62, "end": 926.3, "text": "- What is go..."}, {"start": 926.3, "end": 927.14, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 928.5, "end": 930.06, "text": "You won't be in my commercial,"}, {"start": 930.06, "end": 932.34, "text": "but you'll be in his stupid documentary."}, {"start": 932.34, "end": 933.94, "text": "All he does is follow people around."}, {"start": 933.94, "end": 936.14, "text": "- Yeah, but haven't you seen Hearts of Darkness?"}, {"start": 936.14, "end": 936.98, "text": "Way better than the--"}, {"start": 936.98, "end": 937.94, "text": "- Get the hell off of my canvas,"}, {"start": 937.94, "end": 939.9, "text": "you ungrateful backstabber."}, {"start": 939.9, "end": 941.3, "text": "I already got rid of your trailer."}, {"start": 941.3, "end": 942.3, "text": "- I had a trailer?"}, {"start": 943.46, "end": 944.74, "text": "- Can anyone hear me?"}, {"start": 944.74, "end": 947.06, "text": "I will walk off this production."}, {"start": 947.06, "end": 947.9, "text": "I will quit."}, {"start": 948.9, "end": 949.74, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 949.74, "end": 951.7, "text": "- I come here to shoot this commercial for Greenville."}, {"start": 951.7, "end": 953.14, "text": "That's what you have written in the script."}, {"start": 953.14, "end": 954.64, "text": "- Oh, that script was terrible."}, {"start": 954.64, "end": 955.7, "text": "- I thought it was pretty good."}, {"start": 955.7, "end": 957.3, "text": "- Of course you think that!"}, {"start": 957.3, "end": 958.8, "text": "You went here!"}, {"start": 962.22, "end": 963.06, "text": "- Oh, I get it."}, {"start": 965.06, "end": 966.6, "text": "You're worse than crazy."}, {"start": 967.78, "end": 969.38, "text": "You're ashamed of your school."}, {"start": 969.38, "end": 971.34, "text": "And that statue of me out there?"}, {"start": 971.34, "end": 972.54, "text": "That's just wrong, man."}, {"start": 972.54, "end": 974.02, "text": "- The bronze adds 10 pounds."}, {"start": 974.02, "end": 975.5, "text": "- Nah, man. - It's not gonna be perfect."}, {"start": 975.5, "end": 977.4, "text": "- Screw you."}, {"start": 977.4, "end": 980.62, "text": "I'm just saying, don't worship the people leaving green there."}, {"start": 980.62, "end": 982.7, "text": "Worship the people that are here."}, {"start": 982.7, "end": 985.86, "text": "I worshiped this place. It changes people's lives."}, {"start": 985.86, "end": 989.32, "text": "Look, I love my time here. I got laid like crazy."}, {"start": 989.32, "end": 991.4, "text": "That's way before boogie nights, too."}, {"start": 991.4, "end": 995.16, "text": "Look, this is a special school."}, {"start": 998.42, "end": 999.84, "text": "You don't deserve to be here."}, {"start": 1008.24, "end": 1009.56, "text": "Are you still filming, Abed?"}, {"start": 1009.56, "end": 1010.6, "text": "- Yeah, but try not to address me."}, {"start": 1010.6, "end": 1011.56, "text": "I'm not really here."}, {"start": 1012.7, "end": 1014.94, "text": "Neither am I."}, {"start": 1014.94, "end": 1018.94, "text": "I don't think I can finish my commercial."}, {"start": 1018.94, "end": 1022.64, "text": "But I think I know how your documentary ends."}, {"start": 1026.64, "end": 1027.94, "text": "Hi, I'm Craig Pelton,"}, {"start": 1027.94, "end": 1029.94, "text": "Dean of Greendale Community College."}, {"start": 1031.94, "end": 1034.94, "text": "I have failed this school."}, {"start": 1034.94, "end": 1037.94, "text": "I have failed it because I thought I was better than Greendale."}, {"start": 1037.94, "end": 1040.94, "text": "See, I went to a university."}, {"start": 1040.94, "end": 1041.94, "text": "So I thought it was my job."}, {"start": 1041.94, "end": 1046.9, "text": "it was my job to improve this place, but it turns out that the only thing wrong with Greendale"}, {"start": 1046.9, "end": 1052.26, "text": "is that it's run by an insecure wreck who holds five dances and two talent shows a year"}, {"start": 1052.26, "end": 1057.02, "text": "because he's afraid that the school isn't good enough."}, {"start": 1057.02, "end": 1060.56, "text": "But Greendale is good enough because it accepts me for when I'm not."}, {"start": 1060.56, "end": 1067.02, "text": "Greendale is the best school in the entire world, and I'm so sorry what I've done to it."}, {"start": 1067.02, "end": 1069.82, "text": "And I'm sorry what I've done to the ice cream machine."}, {"start": 1069.86, "end": 1072.4, "text": "[screams]"}, {"start": 1072.42, "end": 1077.06, "text": "Please, no one eat out of it until you clean the nozzles."}, {"start": 1077.1, "end": 1080.7, "text": "The janitor knows how."}, {"start": 1080.74, "end": 1083.38, "text": "I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1083.4, "end": 1085.0, "text": "I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1087.18, "end": 1088.98, "text": "Gentlemen, what I'm about to show you"}, {"start": 1089.02, "end": 1091.18, "text": "is not the commercial you paid me to create."}, {"start": 1091.22, "end": 1094.68, "text": "What I am about to show you is a glimpse into my mind and soul."}, {"start": 1094.72, "end": 1097.24, "text": "And so please hold your questions until the end."}, {"start": 1097.24, "end": 1098.92, "text": "I know you will have a lot of them,"}, {"start": 1098.92, "end": 1101.28, "text": "but I'll understand if you'd rather I just leave."}, {"start": 1106.66, "end": 1108.2, "text": "Why do I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 1108.2, "end": 1110.12, "text": "The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 1110.12, "end": 1112.04, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 1112.04, "end": 1113.48, "text": "With three kids at home, you better"}, {"start": 1113.48, "end": 1115.16, "text": "believe every penny counts."}, {"start": 1115.16, "end": 1116.44, "text": "I love my time."}, {"start": 1116.44, "end": 1118.16, "text": "I got laid like crazy."}, {"start": 1118.16, "end": 1119.3, "text": "So why should you?"}, {"start": 1119.3, "end": 1120.2, "text": "Why should you?"}, {"start": 1120.2, "end": 1122.92, "text": "Why should you go to Greendale?"}, {"start": 1122.92, "end": 1126.48, "text": "Greendale is the best school in the entire world."}, {"start": 1127.48, "end": 1129.98, "text": "Go, Greendale! Go, Greendale! Go!"}, {"start": 1132.22, "end": 1134.56, "text": "It's good. You know what? Better than good."}, {"start": 1134.86, "end": 1135.66, "text": "Good enough."}, {"start": 1135.74, "end": 1138.7, "text": "Is there any more of the crazy Chinese guy?"}, {"start": 1138.78, "end": 1139.58, "text": "He pops."}, {"start": 1139.66, "end": 1142.7, "text": "I'm confused. That's not my commercial. I didn't make that."}, {"start": 1142.78, "end": 1145.66, "text": "Yeah, yeah. Okay, Zemeckis, it moved through you."}, {"start": 1145.74, "end": 1147.62, "text": "Anyway, congratulations."}, {"start": 1147.7, "end": 1149.96, "text": "That should last us another 16 years."}, {"start": 1150.42, "end": 1152.08, "text": "Joe, what's next?"}, {"start": 1152.7, "end": 1153.94, "text": "Chum's trusty bucket."}, {"start": 1153.94, "end": 1154.82, "text": "Quarter taps."}, {"start": 1160.08, "end": 1160.9, "text": "Did you do this?"}, {"start": 1160.9, "end": 1161.82, "text": "You did, mostly."}, {"start": 1161.82, "end": 1163.5, "text": "You got the footage you needed on the first day."}, {"start": 1163.5, "end": 1165.54, "text": "I added a little bit of my footage to fill in the gaps."}, {"start": 1168.76, "end": 1170.46, "text": "I thought you were a fly on the wall."}, {"start": 1170.46, "end": 1173.14, "text": "Some flies are too awesome for the wall."}, {"start": 1173.14, "end": 1174.82, "text": "Documentarians are supposed to be objective,"}, {"start": 1174.82, "end": 1176.88, "text": "to avoid having any effect on the story."}, {"start": 1176.88, "end": 1178.5, "text": "And yet we have more effect than anyone,"}, {"start": 1178.5, "end": 1180.34, "text": "because we decide to tell it."}, {"start": 1180.34, "end": 1181.58, "text": "And we decide how it ends."}, {"start": 1181.58, "end": 1183.24, "text": "\"Will your story be yet another sad one"}, {"start": 1183.24, "end": 1185.32, "text": "\"of yet another man who just wanted to be happy?"}, {"start": 1185.32, "end": 1188.66, "text": "\"Or will your story acknowledge the very nature of stories"}, {"start": 1188.66, "end": 1190.28, "text": "\"and embrace the fact that sharing the sad ones"}, {"start": 1190.28, "end": 1191.84, "text": "\"can sometimes make them happy?\""}, {"start": 1191.84, "end": 1194.76, "text": "- Oh, before you say anything,"}, {"start": 1196.22, "end": 1197.76, "text": "no, I've got nothing."}, {"start": 1197.76, "end": 1199.12, "text": "Can you just forgive me?"}, {"start": 1205.1, "end": 1205.94, "text": "- Yep."}, {"start": 1207.62, "end": 1208.46, "text": "- Why?"}, {"start": 1209.58, "end": 1211.54, "text": "- 'Cause we've all been there."}, {"start": 1211.54, "end": 1213.88, "text": "which is why we're all here."}, {"start": 1218.34, "end": 1219.34, "text": "- Aww. - Aww."}, {"start": 1221.68, "end": 1222.98, "text": "- I'm a good dean."}, {"start": 1222.98, "end": 1223.82, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1225.82, "end": 1229.98, "text": "- Can someone help me get a live possum out of my office?"}, {"start": 1230.98, "end": 1234.48, "text": "It just keeps jumping and skittering."}, {"start": 1234.48, "end": 1238.82, "text": "You think you're prepared and then it skitters again."}, {"start": 1238.82, "end": 1240.32, "text": "- Casey, it's over."}, {"start": 1241.54, "end": 1243.86, "text": "(chuckling)"}, {"start": 1248.58, "end": 1251.34, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1252.78, "end": 1254.84, "text": "- We'll be ready for you in 20 minutes, Mr. Garland."}, {"start": 1254.84, "end": 1255.84, "text": "- Right."}, {"start": 1255.84, "end": 1256.84, "text": "(glass shatters)"}, {"start": 1256.84, "end": 1257.92, "text": "- I'm a star!"}, {"start": 1261.28, "end": 1263.28, "text": "I will not be mitigated."}, {"start": 1268.72, "end": 1270.16, "text": "Okay, you know what?"}, {"start": 1270.16, "end": 1272.92, "text": "I'm not coming out of this trailer until I get a new trailer."}, {"start": 1276.5, "end": 1278.5, "text": "And get me a granola bar!"}]}